        <mxCell id="question" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#14213D;&quot;&gt;PRIMARY ENGINEERING QUESTION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:5px;&quot;&gt;Which Beeline-specific connectivity capabilities, externally exposed states, interfaces, constraints, responsibilities, and pilot operations remain unknown and must be validated before EC-03 assumptions can be carried forward?&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF0F6;strokeColor=#8FA3B8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#1F2933;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="98" width="1010" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="thesis" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#14213D;&quot;&gt;CONTROLLED OPEN STATE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;margin-top:5px;&quot;&gt;15 Q-CONN QUESTIONS REMAIN&lt;br&gt;UNANSWERED / UNOWNED / UNDECIDED.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;§30 records what each unknown affects. It resolves none of them.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C9A94E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontColor=#3A3427;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="98" width="490" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="register" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;height:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;font-family:Arial;font-size:10px;line-height:1.16;color:#1F2933;&quot;&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col style=&quot;width:7%&quot;&gt;&lt;col style=&quot;width:31%&quot;&gt;&lt;col style=&quot;width:27%&quot;&gt;&lt;col style=&quot;width:10%&quot;&gt;&lt;col style=&quot;width:8%&quot;&gt;&lt;col style=&quot;width:8%&quot;&gt;&lt;col style=&quot;width:9%&quot;&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#243B53;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:7px;border:1px solid #8FA3B8;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;Q ID&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:7px;border:1px solid #8FA3B8;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;FULL QUESTION&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:7px;border:1px solid #8FA3B8;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;WHY NEEDED&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:7px;border:1px solid #8FA3B8;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;STATUS&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:7px;border:1px solid #8FA3B8;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;ANSWER&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:7px;border:1px solid #8FA3B8;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;OWNER&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:7px;border:1px solid #8FA3B8;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;DECISION&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Q-CONN-01&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;&quot;&gt;What machine-connectivity service models are available for pilot use?&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;&quot;&gt;Determines feasible connectivity profiles (§17)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#FFF8E6;&quot;&gt;TBD WITH BEELINE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;UNANSWERED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;UNASSIGNED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;NOT RECORDED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#F7F9FB;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Q-CONN-02&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;&quot;&gt;What SIM/eSIM lifecycle capabilities are exposed?&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;&quot;&gt;Needed for EC-04's identity/lifecycle design&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#FFF8E6;&quot;&gt;TBD WITH BEELINE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;UNANSWERED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;UNASSIGNED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;NOT RECORDED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Q-CONN-03&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;&quot;&gt;What connectivity/reachability states can be exposed externally?&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;&quot;&gt;Needed to map §21's proposed states to actual Beeline-exposed states&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#FFF8E6;&quot;&gt;TBD WITH BEELINE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;UNANSWERED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;UNASSIGNED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;NOT RECORDED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#F7F9FB;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Q-CONN-04&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;&quot;&gt;What delivery semantics are available?&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;&quot;&gt;Affects §23's store-and-forward assumptions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#FFF8E6;&quot;&gt;TBD WITH BEELINE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;UNANSWERED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;UNASSIGNED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px;border:1px solid #CBD5E1;text-align:center;font-weight:700;background:#F2F5F8;&quot;&gt;NOT RECORDED&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
